{"version":1,"content":"<p>【重大突破 😆】Sony PS5 旗艦級賽車大作《Gran Turismo 7》（下稱《GT7》）已成功在 PC 模擬器上進入實機遊玩畫面。</p><p>根據開發者釋出的最新展示影片，證實該作能在 Windows 系統下透過實驗性質的模擬器進行運算。</p><p>儘管目前平均幀率僅介乎 17 至 25 FPS 之間，尚未達到流暢遊玩門檻，但畫面完整度已遠超外界預期。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:41:37.188950+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:18:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T19:37:54.688077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:37:43.906448+00:00","content_hash":"a6c3568d213ba9c883748e25708500b651c2506cbbafba552e915e2dade5abfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}